---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  heading="Affiliate disclosure"
  description="How DriveTested makes money: we are a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program and may earn commissions on qualifying purchases."
>
  <p><strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong></p>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program
    designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.
  </p>
  <p>
    This means that when you click a link on our site (such as a "Check price on Amazon" button) and make a purchase,
    we may receive a small commission. It costs you nothing extra; the price you pay is the same.
  </p>

  <h2>Does this affect our recommendations?</h2>
  <p>
    No. We choose products based on our research and testing process, described on our
    <a href="/how-we-test/">How We Test</a> page. Brands cannot pay to be included or to change our verdicts, and we
    regularly recommend against products that would earn us a commission.
  </p>

  <h2>Other affiliate programs</h2>
  <p>
    We may also join affiliate programs run by other retailers or manufacturers. Any link that can earn us a commission
    is marked as sponsored in our code, and this page applies to all of them.
  </p>

  <h2>Prices and availability</h2>
  <p>
    We don't list prices on our pages because they change frequently. Product prices and availability are accurate as
    of the date and time indicated on Amazon and are subject to change. Any price and availability information displayed
    on Amazon at the time of purchase will apply to the purchase of the product.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Get in touch any time via our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
